gagement and participatory planning', 'Engage communities in decision-making and planning processes, ensuring local voices and needs are incorporated into sustainable development projects.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_ADULT_014', 'Adult education', 'Community engagement and participatory planning', 'Organise community workshops or town halls to discuss urban regeneration projects, gathering feedback to ensure plans address the needs of marginalised groups.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_ADULT_015', 'Adult education', 'Resilient infrastructure design and management', 'Design and manage infrastructure that can withstand the impacts of climate change, such as floods, heatwaves and extreme weather events.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_ADULT_016', 'Adult education', 'Resilient infrastructure design and management', 'Develop resilient stormwater management systems to mitigate flooding risks in urban areas or retrofit existing infrastructure for future climate challenges.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_ADULT_017', 'Adult education', 'Integration of circular economy principles in urban development', 'Apply circular economy principles to urban systems, focusing on material reuse, waste reduction and designing products for longer lifespans.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG11_ADULT_018', 'Adult education', 'Integration of circular economy principles in urban development', 'Develop citywide recycling programmes that reduce landfill waste or work with local industries to design buildings and products that can be disassembled and reused.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG12_SEC_001', 'Secondary education', 'Data literacy and critical thinking', 'Analyse statistics on waste, carbon footprints, and resource use.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG12_SEC_002', 'Secondary education', 'Data literacy and critical thinking', 'Compare ecological and social impacts of different consumption models.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG12_SEC_003', 'Secondary education', 'Systems and supply chain analysis', 'Audit supply chains of common products (e.g., jeans,